{
  "id": "350",
  "title": "Will the Flight be Delayed?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-08-13",
  "synopsis": "Ben's flight might be delayed due to heavy rain.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/488/0105cdaa087703cc9fe1a1cd7c7a7a0f5df699fb.mp3?1698352588",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "飞机会晚点吗？\n\n丽丽：本，办好登机手续了吗？\n本：办好了。\n丽丽：那就好。雨下得那么大，飞机会晚点吗？\n本：不知道。\n丽丽：我去帮你看看。\n几分钟后……\n丽丽：飞机会准时起飞。你快去安检吧！\n本：好的！谢谢！再见！\n丽丽：再见！一路平安！",
    "traditional": "飛機會晚點嗎？\n\n麗麗：本，辦好登機手續了嗎？\n本：辦好了。\n麗麗：那就好。雨下得那麼大，飛機會晚點嗎？\n本：不知道。\n麗麗：我去幫你看看。\n幾分鐘後……\n麗麗：飛機會準時起飛。你快去安檢吧！\n本：好的！謝謝！再見！\n麗麗：再見！一路平安！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Will the flight be delayed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，办好登机手续了吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，辦好登機手續了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn bàn hǎo dēng jī shǒu xù le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, have you finished the check in procedure?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：办好了。",
      "traditional": "本：辦好了。",
      "pinyin": "běn bàn hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那就好。雨下得那么大，飞机会晚点吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那就好。雨下得那麼大，飛機會晚點嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà jiù hǎo yǔ xià de nà me dà fēi jī huì wǎn diǎn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Good. It's raining a lot, will the flight be delayed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：不知道。",
      "traditional": "本：不知道。",
      "pinyin": "běn bù zhī dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I dunno."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我去帮你看看。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我去幫你看看。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ qù bāng nǐ kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I'll go help you check."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "几分钟后……",
      "traditional": "幾分鐘後……",
      "pinyin": "jǐ fēn zhōng hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A few minutes later…"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：飞机会准时起飞。你快去安检吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：飛機會準時起飛。你快去安檢吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì fēi jī huì zhǔn shí qǐ fēi nǐ kuài qù ān jiǎn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The flight will leave on time. Hurry up to the security check!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：好的！谢谢！再见！",
      "traditional": "本：好的！謝謝！再見！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright! Thank you! Bye bye!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：再见！一路平安！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：再見！一路平安！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài jiàn yí lù píng ān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Bye bye! Have a safe trip!"
    }
  ],
